<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Container</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Boston Manor</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Sundiver</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1zq9PdJBzjq5Xw9OSdETXI</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作词: "},{"tx":"Henry Cox"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作曲: "},{"tx":"Henry Cox"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Ash Wilson"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Jordan Pugh"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Mike Cunniff"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Dan Cunniff"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Is anybody out there now?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Is anybody real?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Then run to the back door &amp;</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Run til you’re new</p><p ttm:agent="v1">&amp; pull that loose thread that’s been bothering you.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Don’t turn around and look away what ever you do</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I just woke up like this</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Container (leave it &amp; run)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It’s taken everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Container</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Mass appeal</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Can you feel with your face to the wall?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Left in the last in the dark away from it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1">No oxygen in the ceiling</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nothing that’s left to believe in now</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nothing to believe in now</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I just woke up like this</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Container (leave it &amp; run)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It’s taken everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Container</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Don’t tell me who you are</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Show me what you’re made of</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Show me who you are</p></div></body></tt>